4>1, 1/4, 2=3D3, 2>1, 3>4, so 3>1, 2>4 and 1/2. 1/3, 4/2,3
These remarks are essentially domain independent (ignoring domains with onl=
y one=20
chihuahua) and I don't see any reason why one domain rather than another is=
 to=20
be chosen, unless it is to make an inference from 1 to 2 or 4 to 3 go throu=
gh. =20
But domains with only one chihuahua (assuming it has any at all) are highly=
