implausible.  So, I don't get what is going on here (or, rather, I do, but =
am=20
damned if I will give it the satisfaction of actually saying it so far).
So, to go back to basics, {lo broda} refers to a bunch of broda (no metaphy=
sical=20
commitments here, just a fac,on de parler that is easier to work with in so=
me=20
fine cases) and iis neutral with respect to how its referent is related to=
