various predicates (including {broda}, in fact).  Lojban lacks the means to=
 say=20
explicitly what that relation is in most cases, but, in any case, saying wh=
at=20
that relation is is not a matter to be taken up by a gadri, but at the=20
sumti-selbri interface, if at all.  And, it needs to be noted, the choices =
are=20
not limited to (conjunctive) distribution and collection, but include at le=
ast=20
